# Text files are checked out with LF on every OS. The audit chain, the conformance vectors, the checked-in tables and the
# golden fixtures are hashed or compared byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout (Windows, core.autocrlf) must not change them.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Byte-exact fixtures: never converted, on any OS.
tests/golden/* text eol=lf
conformance/vectors/* text eol=lf
